# GitHub language bar: count product code, hide noise.
*.ts linguist-detectable=true
*.tsx linguist-detectable=true
*.js linguist-detectable=false
*.mjs linguist-detectable=false
*.css linguist-documentation
package-lock.json linguist-generated
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
public/** linguist-vendored
scripts/** linguist-vendored
*.svg linguist-vendored
*.png linguist-vendored
*.ico linguist-vendored
